(Helios Semiconductor Inc. reported Q3 FY2026 revenue of 4.12 billion USD, up 41% year over) Tj
T*
(year and 9% sequentially. Data centre accelerators contributed 3.05 billion USD of that) Tj
T*
(total, the first quarter in which the segment passed 70% of group revenue. Gross margin) Tj
